			"notes": "## Nora Tweaks — Build 7\nSupported Versions: 1.21.4, 1.21.5, 1.21.6, 1.21.7, 1.21.8, 1.21.9, 1.21.10, 1.21.11\n\n### Changes\nAdded support for Catpuccin addon (https://github.com/X-C-0/Catpuccin-Addon/issues/12)\nAdded support for 1.21.4, 1.21.5, 1.21.6, 1.21.9 versions and naturally solved #10 and #3 \n\n\n### Notes\nDownload the file corresponding to your Minecraft version.\n\nThere may be problems on Oresim with baritone-unoptimized or baritone-api for 1.21.4, 1.21.5, 1.21.6, 1.21.9 versions. I recommend usage of baritone-meteor unless you really need those versions. If there's an issue, feel free to notice me for a fix by creating an issue or on [Discord](https://discord.gg/rRFf5JJWhd)"
		}
